# The shipped agent skills live in-tree at
# src/codeprobe/skills_data/codeprobe-*/SKILL.md and are declared in
# [tool.setuptools.package-data], which covers both the wheel and the sdist —
# nothing to include here.
#
# Never add `recursive-include .claude ...` (or a graft): .claude/skills/ is a
# shared namespace, and a recursive rule would sweep whatever machine-local
# agent skills the person running `python -m build` happens to have into a
# public sdist.
